    <text>
        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1757_6475.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freuendtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dienst</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">grueß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuvor</unclear> edler
<lb n="2"/>ehrenvester und weiser insonders lieber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Herr</unclear> Landt=
<lb n="3"/>vogt, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gueter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündt</unclear> und nachbar.
<lb n="4"/>Nach dem weilandt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Stattaman</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Hannß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zündts</unclear></persName> seligen erben,
<lb n="5"/>unsers gewesnen lieben mitburgers, weilandt <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Davids</unclear>
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Voegelijers</unclear></persName> seligen wittiben, bewußter an sprach halber,
<lb n="7"/>unlangst alhie mit recht fürgenomen, seindt ihre <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vor=</unclear>
<lb n="8"/>münder und voegt, uf <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dato</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> widerumb erschin=
<lb n="9"/>en, unnd sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erclert</unclear>, daß sie nachmalen wie
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">je</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allewegen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">urbiütig</unclear> unnd willig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seijen</unclear>,
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jenigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uncosten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etwo</unclear> die verstorbne magdt,
<lb n="12"/>es <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seije</unclear> mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pflegnus</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begraebnus</unclear>, oder <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">andern</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">der=</unclear>
<lb n="13"/>gleichen (doch allein was ihr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ainizige</unclear> person
<lb n="14"/>erhaltung und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">betreffen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuet</unclear>,) nach aller gebür zu=
<lb n="15"/>erstatten. Wie sie dann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuedem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">end</unclear> von
<lb n="16"/>den erben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">albereit</unclear> ein rechnung begert, sich in
<lb n="17"/>derselben zuersehen haben, und darüber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ferner</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebür</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürzünemen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüssen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moegen</unclear>, die
<lb n="19"/>sie aber von inen bißher nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zühanden</unclear> bringen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">moegen</unclear>,
<lb n="20"/>warumb und uf was intent man inen dieselbige nit
<lb n="21"/>hab übergeben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woellen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moegen</unclear> sie zwar so gar aigent=
<lb n="22"/>lich nicht wüssen. Dieweil aber die
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">voegt</unclear> und vormünder, die sach also lenger anstehen
<lb n="24"/>zülassen auß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bewegenden</unclear> ursachen nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bedacht</unclear>,
<lb n="25"/>habendt sie <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gehorsamlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ersuecht</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> gebetten,
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> als der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zündischen</unclear> erben ainem ussem rhystaal,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1757_6476.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">als</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ordenliche</unclear> oberkeit, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schriftlichen</unclear>,
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zulangen</unclear>, das Ihr die gemelte zündische erben
<lb n="29"/>dahin wellen vermögen, damit sie mehrgedach-
<lb n="30"/>ten wittiben oder ihren vormünderen, die begerte
<lb n="31"/>rechnung schriftlich überantwurten, oder aber,
<lb n="32"/>da solches bey Ihnen nicht verfahen möchte, den vor-
<lb n="33"/>mündern ein tag zuverhörung ihrer habenden,
<lb n="34"/>und mit recht allbereit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erkandten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kundtschaft</unclear>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zubestimmen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> zu <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">demselbigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gegentheil</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schriftlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuverkünden</unclear>.
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sidmalen</unclear> dann unß diß begeren nit unzimblich
<lb n="38"/>bedunckt, so habenn wir dasselbig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nicht</unclear>
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verweigern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">söllen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wellen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Und</unclear>
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diewil</unclear> wir disere sach lieber in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">güete</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear>
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">recht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erörtert</unclear> sehen, so versehend wir unß zu
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eüch</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersuchend</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hierumb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündt</unclear>-
<lb n="43"/>lich, Ihr werden und wöllend, die mehrbesagte
<lb n="44"/>zündische erben dahin anweißen, daß sie
<lb n="45"/>die begerte rechnung unverlengt von handen gebe,
<lb n="46"/>zwifflet unß nit, die vormünder werden die
<lb n="47"/>erber und billigheit, obangeregter maßen,
<lb n="48"/>ohne rechtlichen proceß erstatten, und dar-
<lb n="49"/>durch der sachen abgeholffen werden. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Uf</unclear>
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unverhoften</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fahl</unclear> aber solche rechnung nit
<lb n="51"/>herauß gebracht werden mag, so habend
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1757_6477.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="52"/>wir zu verhoerung der erkannten kundtschafft,
<lb n="53"/>wir sige den <date resp="#ner">15ten den allernechstkuenfftigen mitwuch morgens
<lb n="54"/>diß monats Aprilis umb acht uhren</date>, allhie anberueffte tag uff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßern</unclear>
<lb n="55"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alten</unclear> <orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Calenders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rathhuß</unclear></orgName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weßhalb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verordneten</unclear>
<lb n="56"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bestimbt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> angesetzt, und begeren
<lb n="57"/>daruff an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Üch</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ihr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wellet</unclear> bey oberkeit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">we</unclear>-
<lb n="58"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">huenlischen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Erben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verkünden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>,
<lb n="59"/>damit, so sie wellen, sie sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abendts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeith</unclear> allhie
<lb n="60"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erschinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zustellen</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zügen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beaidigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoeren</unclear>,
<lb n="61"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ihre</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fernnere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">notturfft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürzuwen</unclear>-
<lb n="62"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüßen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dan</unclear> sie erschinen oder aber
<lb n="63"/>nit, werde nichtdestminder die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zügen</unclear>
<lb n="64"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhört</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">volgends</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fernerer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebür</unclear>
<lb n="65"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nach</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">procediert</unclear> werden. wolten wir
<lb n="66"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Üch</unclear> zue <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eüweren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachrichtung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nach</unclear>-
<lb n="67"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">barlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nicht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bergen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gueten</unclear> nach-
<lb n="68"/>barschafft und angenemen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diensterzeigung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ieder</unclear>-
<lb n="69"/>zeit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolgeneigt</unclear> sind. Datum den <origDate when="1612-04-09" resp="#ner">9ten
<lb n="70"/>Aprilis. Anno. 1612.</origDate>
<lb n="71"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">B</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">u</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">R</unclear>. d. statt</orgName>
<lb n="72"/>An herrn <persName role="recipient" resp="#ner">Johans Ludwig Wuertz</persName>, Landtvogt zu <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-87" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Rorschach</placeName>. <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">St. Gallen</placeName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1757_6478.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="73"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">An</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">H</unclear>. <persName role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Lavogt</unclear></persName> im <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-64" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rinthal</unclear></placeName>. <origDate when="1612-04-09" resp="#ner">9. Aprilis
<lb n="74"/>1612.</origDate>
</p>
